    "created_at": "2019-09-07T18:08:36Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-07T18:08:36Z",
    "body": "Thinking it over some more, maybe `timeout` should have a sane default and be in \"Advanced Configuration\". I don't think most people would need or want to touch timeout.",
