    "created_at": "2019-09-08T07:36:28Z",
    "updated_at": "2019-09-08T07:36:28Z",
    "body": "One of the main reasons I've switched to starship recently is that the prompt is ready faster than with my old zsh+plugins configuration.\r\n\r\nFor me I'd prefer the terminal be ready as fast as possible as most of the time I'm in the terminal to run commands. The auxiliary information is handy but it's usually not the primary focus. \r\n\r\nI'm not sure on the specifics but would it be possible to render the prompt and then update the git/extra information when it becomes available or instead error after the timeout?\r\n\r\n",
    "author_association": "NONE",
    "pin": null,
