    "body": "An anecdote in support of timeouts:\r\n\r\nThe other day I had to switch from wpa_supplicant to NetworkManager. During the switch, I borked the network, and my default shell became totally unusable. Starship would not reach the prompt.\r\n\r\nTo fix, I had to reboot into safe mode and disable the NetworkManager service.\r\n\r\nEDIT: Perhaps this is a separate issue, but I think eventually starship should give up doing whatever it was doing.\r\n\r\nEDIT 2: I can reproduce the issue by disabling wifi. Spaceship does not have the same problem.",
